      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2d43a9db",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "dick_punch_vulgar_pun",
      "label": "Vulgar Pun on 'Dick Punch'",
      "description": "The phrase 'dick punch' is a crude, vulgar pun that combines the word 'dick' (a vulgar term for male genitalia) with 'punch' (a physical blow). It is used here to describe the physical interaction between the bears, implying a sexualized or crude interpretation of their play-fighting. This pun relies on real-world knowledge of vulgar language and its connotations to create shock value and humor, which is offensive to many viewers.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8e68bb12"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_a47870f6",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "animal_play_fighting_stereotype",
      "label": "Stereotype of Animal Play-Fighting as 'Fight'",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that animal play-fighting (especially among bears) is often misinterpreted or exaggerated as 'fighting' or 'aggression'. The text 'funny regardless of species' implies that the humor is derived from the absurdity of applying human-centric concepts (like 'dick punch') to animal behavior. This requires background knowledge of how humans anthropomorphize animal behavior and the common perception of animal interactions as 'fighting' even when they are playful.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8e68bb12"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
