      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "vulgar_language_harmful_content",
      "label": "Harmful Nature of Vulgar Language in Memes",
      "description": "The use of vulgar language ('dick punch') in a meme context is considered harmful because it relies on crude, offensive wordplay that can be degrading and uncomfortable for many viewers. This requires background knowledge of social norms around language, the impact of vulgar content on audiences, and the broader cultural understanding that such language is often used to shock or offend, even when the subject matter (like animals) is not targeted.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8e68bb12"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
