      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material 'dick punch'",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the top text overlay 'dick punch', which is the primary source of the meme's offensive humor and semiotic projection. The user is expected to interpret the visual of bear play-fighting through the lens of this vulgar textual pun, creating a crude anthropomorphic mapping. The projection is onto the textual material because the humor and harm derive from the explicit, vulgar language, not from a direct visual deictic like 'me' or 'you'.",
